---
// ZhongSai V2 - English Terms of Use Page
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const lang = 'en';
const title = 'Terms of Use | ZhongSai Steel Structure';
const description = 'Terms of use for the ZhongSai Steel Structure website, including project information, quotations, supply scope and local construction responsibility.';
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} lang={lang}>
  <section class="legal-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hub-breadcrumb">
        <a href="/en/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>Terms of Use</span>
      </div>
      <p class="eyebrow">LEGAL</p>
      <h1>Terms of Use</h1>
      <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: September 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-content">
    <div class="container legal-container">
      <div class="legal-toc">
        <h3>Contents</h3>
        <ol>
          <li><a href="#website-purpose">Website Purpose</a></li>
          <li><a href="#project-info">Project Information and Quotations</a></li>
          <li><a href="#technical-info">Technical Information</a></li>
          <li><a href="#drawings">Drawings and Uploaded Materials</a></li>
          <li><a href="#supply-scope">Supply Scope</a></li>
          <li><a href="#local-construction">Local Construction Responsibility</a></li>
          <li><a href="#ip">Intellectual Property</a></li>
          <li><a href="#third-party">Third-Party Links</a></li>
          <li><a href="#availability">Website Availability</a></li>
          <li><a href="#limitation">Limitation of Website Information</a></li>
          <li><a href="#changes">Changes to These Terms</a></li>
          <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-body">
        <h2 id="website-purpose">1. Website Purpose</h2>
        <p>The ZhongSai Steel Structure website ("the Website") provides general business information about ZhongSai's steel structure design, detailing, fabrication and export supply services. The Website is intended for business-to-business communication and project inquiry purposes.</p>
        <p>Website content is general business information. Specific quotations, specifications, supply scope, delivery schedules and commercial terms are confirmed separately for each project.</p>

        <h2 id="project-info">2. Project Information and Quotations</h2>
        <p>Information displayed on the Website, including product descriptions, capability statements, project examples and service descriptions, is provided for general reference and does not automatically constitute a binding quotation, offer or contract.</p>
        <p>Quotes become project-specific only after relevant scope and information are reviewed and confirmed, including project drawings, specifications, material requirements, delivery conditions and other project-specific details. Any quotation issued by ZhongSai is subject to the terms and conditions stated in that specific quotation.</p>

        <h2 id="technical-info">3. Technical Information</h2>
        <p>Technical information presented on the Website, including descriptions of structural systems, manufacturing processes, component types and surface treatment options, is general in nature and may vary by project.</p>
        <p>Dimensions, materials, structural systems, surface treatment, loading requirements and other technical information may vary by project and are confirmed according to project drawings, specifications and agreed requirements. Specific technical parameters for any project should be confirmed through direct communication with ZhongSai.</p>

        <h2 id="drawings">4. Drawings and Uploaded Materials</h2>
        <p>You may submit drawings, BOQ files, specifications and other project documents through the Website's inquiry form. These materials are used to understand, evaluate and communicate about the submitted project requirement.</p>
        <p>Customer-submitted drawings and documents remain subject to the rights of their respective owners. By submitting materials, you represent that you have the right to provide these documents for project evaluation and communication purposes.</p>

        <h2 id="supply-scope">5. Supply Scope</h2>
        <p>ZhongSai is a steel structure manufacturer and export supplier. The supply scope for each project is confirmed based on project requirements, drawings and agreed commercial terms. ZhongSai's supply may include design and detailing support, fabrication, steel components, packing, container loading, export documentation support, logistics coordination and overseas installation technical guidance.</p>
        <p>The specific supply scope for any project is defined in the project agreement or quotation and may differ from the general descriptions on the Website.</p>

        <h2 id="local-construction">6. Local Construction Responsibility</h2>
        <p>ZhongSai is a steel structure manufacturer and export supplier. Local erection, local construction, local site labor and local statutory approvals are handled by the customer or local project team unless a specific written agreement states otherwise.</p>
        <p>ZhongSai may provide overseas installation technical guidance according to the confirmed project scope, including installation drawings, video resources and technical support. Such guidance does not constitute local construction, erection or site management services unless explicitly agreed in writing.</p>

        <h2 id="ip">7. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>The Website content, including text, branding, official logo, page design, company images and other materials, is protected by applicable intellectual property laws and may not be reproduced, distributed or used for commercial purposes without prior written consent from ZhongSai.</p>
        <p>Customer-submitted drawings and documents remain subject to the rights of their respective owners. ZhongSai uses submitted materials solely for project evaluation, communication and supply coordination purposes related to the submitted inquiry.</p>

        <h2 id="third-party">8. Third-Party Links</h2>
        <p>The Website may contain links to third-party websites or resources. These links are provided for convenience and reference only. ZhongSai does not endorse, warrant or assume responsibility for the content, accuracy or practices of any third-party website. Your use of third-party websites is subject to their respective terms and privacy policies.</p>

        <h2 id="availability">9. Website Availability</h2>
        <p>ZhongSai endeavors to maintain the Website's availability and functionality, but does not guarantee uninterrupted or error-free access. The Website may be temporarily unavailable due to maintenance, updates, technical issues or circumstances beyond our control. ZhongSai reserves the right to modify, suspend or discontinue any part of the Website at any time without prior notice.</p>

        <h2 id="limitation">10. Limitation of Website Information</h2>
        <p>The Website is provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis. ZhongSai makes reasonable efforts to ensure the accuracy of Website content, but does not warrant that the Website is free from errors or that all information is current, complete or applicable to every project situation.</p>
        <p>To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, ZhongSai shall not be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, consequential or special damages arising from your use of, or reliance on, the Website or its content. This limitation does not apply to liability that cannot be excluded under applicable law.</p>

        <h2 id="changes">11. Changes to These Terms</h2>
        <p>ZhongSai may update these Terms of Use from time to time to reflect changes in our practices, services or legal requirements. When we make significant changes, we will update the "Last updated" date at the top of this page. Your continued use of the Website after changes are posted constitutes acceptance of the updated terms.</p>

        <h2 id="contact">12. Contact</h2>
        <p>If you have questions about these Terms of Use, please contact us through:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Email:</strong> zhongsaiganggou@gmail.com</li>
          <li><strong>WhatsApp / Phone:</strong> +86 131 9200 7378</li>
          <li><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="/en/contact/">Project Inquiry Form</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
.legal-hero {
  padding: 48px 0 32px;
  background: var(--bg-light, #f8f9fa);
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
}
.legal-hero h1 {
  font-size: 2rem;
  margin: 12px 0 8px;
  color: var(--primary, #0a3d62);
}
.legal-updated {
  color: var(--text-secondary, #888);
  font-size: 0.9rem;
}
.legal-content {
  padding: 48px 0;
}
.legal-container {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 280px 1fr;
  gap: 48px;
  align-items: start;
}
.legal-toc {
  position: sticky;
  top: 24px;
  padding: 24px;
  background: var(--bg-light, #f8f9fa);
  border-radius: 10px;
}
.legal-toc h3 {
  font-size: 1rem;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
  color: var(--primary, #0a3d62);
}
.legal-toc ol {
  padding-left: 20px;
  margin: 0;
}
.legal-toc li {
  margin-bottom: 8px;
  font-size: 0.88rem;
}
.legal-toc a {
  color: var(--text-secondary, #555);
  text-decoration: none;
}
.legal-toc a:hover {
  color: var(--primary, #0a3d62);
}
.legal-body {
  max-width: 800px;
}
.legal-body h2 {
  font-size: 1.3rem;
  margin: 40px 0 16px;
  color: var(--primary, #0a3d62);
  padding-top: 16px;
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
}
.legal-body h2:first-child {
  margin-top: 0;
  padding-top: 0;
  border-top: none;
}
.legal-body p {
  margin-bottom: 16px;
  line-height: 1.75;
  color: var(--text-secondary, #444);
  font-size: 0.98rem;
}
.legal-body ul {
  margin-bottom: 16px;
  padding-left: 24px;
}
.legal-body li {
  margin-bottom: 8px;
  line-height: 1.65;
  color: var(--text-secondary, #444);
  font-size: 0.95rem;
}
.legal-body a {
  color: var(--primary, #0a3d62);
}
@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .legal-container {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
  .legal-toc {
    position: static;
  }
}
@media (max-width: 600px) {
  .legal-hero h1 {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
  }
  .legal-body h2 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
  }
}
</style>
